  "type": "json_object",
  "message": "I interpret the increase as the net change in the unrecognized tax benefits balance from the beginning of 2007 to the end of 2008. Inputs: beginning 2007 balance = 70.5 (source:t1c2n0) and ending 2008 balance = 214.4 (source:t8c1n0), both in $ millions.",
